<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent Pakistani train derailments have killed four passengers and injured dozens in Multan and central Pakistan, while a separate blast near the LoC killed four men. Afghan Taliban fighters have been accused by Pakistan of using Afghan soil to launch cross-border attacks, and the Taliban have responded by accusing Pakistan of baseless allegations as clashes intensify. Pakistani security forces killed five terrorists in an intelligence-based operation in Washuk. The Taliban also claimed that natural disasters have killed 679 people. The conflict caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOWWY5R0tRck0wWHhLX3dOQjJEZ1FMSE5nX2FMMUFUeDZGY0NWY2JidDJMSDY3YnVHZmxCSHdTcEQxSG5RRTM4QmRMQnIwaVVfNHFmM053TDU3a2VpcGh3TF9adzJULXA0c2FOYjhOWW1NMWJKZG00TjNMenRzdUdpUmlKUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WION&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNMHJ3bHliQXhrZ1I3TWIwdFNEUXNDcGhpd2F2dlZhQW1ZQmNuSDE3Z1FFZkhERWxTSmJpaVJrSEEwRFV0RkdBSElMazhEbldvTzBNV19RdDhPazlkNWV1UTBJUmctZ3hzZ3ZLbkRaNFFWZVRIb2UyMTdDYkRTbVZwbVF5cDhNdUV2UjlBRUU2VTdqU0Q2MUtGZElOaXZpS0Jp?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab Times Kuwait News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPQWc2X3ZYWXNHY3ZvTkFrWVZQM2dKd1ZQdlQ4Q1dFU25JdU1zaE5NZ2k1SU9heTYwR3M5S1JTR0haTVVoekNyNWppeGR3YnRUUEljVjhzMFZIbWhtdEpfM3ZwYzJkQ1FQalZzVHFnUHdxU0R3bDBFSVFPS3VmQk9qTklEUEFvbmZhX0Exb0dZQ29lcDhRRjhCOW9KTm5UMGFraEZQN0FHaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQWkhzenZBN0ItUTd2Z0c